{{Documentation/Header}}
Places an empty, permanently hidden portable infobox on a page. It renders an <code><nowiki><infobox></nowiki></code> containing a single unpopulated data row, wrapped in a <code>display:none</code> container, so nothing is visible to readers.

Its purpose is to make a page count as having an infobox for tooling that keys off one, without showing an infobox to the reader. It takes no parameters.

Currently used on [[Nayuta (female)/Discography]].

==Syntax==
{{T|GhostInfobox}}

==Usage==
<pre>{{GhostInfobox}}</pre>
Place it anywhere on the page; position has no visual effect.
